---
// BiohackingLab.astro — Cellular Recovery Chamber & Science
---

<section class="section biohack" id="biohacking">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="biohack__head reveal">
      <span class="mono-tag">05 // RECUPERACIÓN CELULAR &amp; BIOHACKING</span>
      <h2 class="display-title biohack__title">
        RECOVERY <span class="highlight-volt">CHAMBER</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="biohack__desc">
        La adaptación neuromuscular ocurre durante la recuperación celular, no en el esfuerzo. Nuestro protocolo de biohacking acelera la síntesis proteica y neutraliza la inflamación sistémica.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Interactive Biohack Grid -->
    <div class="biohack__grid reveal">
      <!-- Feature 1: Cryo -110°C -->
      <div class="biohack-card biohack-card--cryo">
        <div class="biohack-card__tag">CRIOTERAPIA // SENSOR -110°C</div>
        <div class="biohack-card__val">-110°C</div>
        <h3 class="biohack-card__title">Whole-Body Cryo Chamber</h3>
        <p class="biohack-card__txt">
          Exposición controlada de 3 minutos a nitrógeno seco. Provoca vasoconstricción masiva y liberación inmediata de endorfinas, norepinefrina y proteínas de choque térmico frío.
        </p>
        <div class="biohack-card__metric">
          <div class="biohack-metric-box">
            <span class="m-val">-68%</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">INFLAMACIÓN</span>
          </div>
          <div class="biohack-metric-box">
            <span class="m-val">+250%</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">DOPAMINA</span>
          </div>
          <div class="biohack-metric-box">
            <span class="m-val">3 MIN</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">PROTOCOLO</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Infrared Sauna -->
      <div class="biohack-card biohack-card--infrared">
        <div class="biohack-card__tag">INFRARROJO // TERMOTERAPIA</div>
        <div class="biohack-card__val">+85°C</div>
        <h3 class="biohack-card__title">Full-Spectrum Infrared Sauna</h3>
        <p class="biohack-card__txt">
          Ondas infrarrojas lejanas que penetran hasta 4 cm en el tejido muscular profundo, estimulando la biogénesis mitocondrial, vasodilatación y desintoxicación por sudoración profunda.
        </p>
        <div class="biohack-card__metric">
          <div class="biohack-metric-box">
            <span class="m-val">+42%</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">SUEÑO PROFUNDO</span>
          </div>
          <div class="biohack-metric-box">
            <span class="m-val">+85%</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">CIRCULACIÓN</span>
          </div>
          <div class="biohack-metric-box">
            <span class="m-val">20 MIN</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">PROTOCOLO</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Cold Plunge 3°C -->
      <div class="biohack-card biohack-card--plunge">
        <div class="biohack-card__tag">COLD PLUNGE // CONTRASTE</div>
        <div class="biohack-card__val">3°C</div>
        <h3 class="biohack-card__title">Ice Bath Regeneration</h3>
        <p class="biohack-card__txt">
          Inmersión en agua helada filtrada con ozono y flujo laminar continuo para evitar capas de gradiente térmico. Aumenta la variabilidad cardíaca (HRV) y la resiliencia del sistema nervioso.
        </p>
        <div class="biohack-card__metric">
          <div class="biohack-metric-box">
            <span class="m-val">+35%</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">BALANCE HRV</span>
          </div>
          <div class="biohack-metric-box">
            <span class="m-val">-50%</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">DOLOR DOMS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="biohack-metric-box">
            <span class="m-val">4 MIN</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">PROTOCOLO</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Science Deep-Dive Banner -->
    <div class="biohack__banner reveal">
      <div class="biohack__banner-left">
        <span class="mono-tag">EL ESTÁNDAR BIOMÉDICO</span>
        <h3 class="biohack__banner-title">Evaluación InBody 770 &amp; Mapeo 3D</h3>
        <p class="biohack__banner-txt">
          Cada atleta recibe un análisis segmental de masa muscular por bioimpedancia multifrecuencia, balance hídrico intra/extracelular y variabilidad cardíaca cada 30 días.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="biohack__banner-right">
        <a href="#vip-pass" class="btn btn-volt">
          <span>EXPERIMENTAR EL SPA</span>
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.biohack {
  background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}

.biohack__head {
  max-width: 680px;
  margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
}

.biohack__title {
  font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  margin-block: 0.5rem 1rem;
}

.biohack__desc {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* Grid */
.biohack__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}

.biohack-card {
  background: #06080D;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  position: relative;
  transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
}

.biohack-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-8px);
}

.biohack-card--cryo:hover {
  border-color: var(--color-cyber);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
}

.biohack-card--infrared:hover {
  border-color: var(--color-flame);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(255, 62, 62, 0.2);
}

.biohack-card--plunge:hover {
  border-color: var(--color-volt);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(217, 255, 0, 0.2);
}

.biohack-card__tag {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.biohack-card__val {
  font-family: var(--font-tech);
  font-size: 3.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.biohack-card--cryo .biohack-card__val { color: var(--color-cyber); }
.biohack-card--infrared .biohack-card__val { color: var(--color-flame); }
.biohack-card--plunge .biohack-card__val { color: var(--color-volt); }

.biohack-card__title {
  font-family: var(--font-tech);
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
}

.biohack-card__txt {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  flex: 1;
}

.biohack-card__metric {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 0.5rem;
  background: rgba(16, 22, 36, 0.6);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  padding: 0.85rem 0.5rem;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  text-align: center;
}

.m-val {
  font-family: var(--font-tech);
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  display: block;
}

.m-lbl {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.15rem;
}

/* Banner */
.biohack__banner {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #101624 0%, #0A0F18 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-volt);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 2rem;
}

.biohack__banner-title {
  font-family: var(--font-tech);
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  margin-block: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
}

.biohack__banner-txt {
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  max-width: 620px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .biohack__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .biohack__banner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
}
</style>
